\fs36 \cf0 This script removes all copies of the currently playing track from all playlists and moves its file to the Trash. 
\f2\i Use carefully!
\f0\i0\fs24 \
\

\f1\b \cf2 How to use:
\f0\b0 \cf0 \
\
Put this script in your iTunes Scripts folder. This is located in 
\f2\i \cf3 home > Library > iTunes
\f0\i0 \cf0 . If there is no Scripts folder there, create one and put the script in it. It will then appear in iTunes' Scripts Menu, where you can select it by clicking on its name.\
\
While a track is playing, run this script. If it can, it will remove all copies of the track from any playlists it is listed in and move its audio file to the Trash.\
\
\'a5 If for some reason the file cannot be moved to the Trash, the script will try to open its folder in the Finder so you can investigate further.\
\
